# HVN132 (2026-08-03, ICAO24 40fc4a00) real ADS-B replay -- last ~6.5 min
# before touchdown through taxi-to-gate at VVDN, exiting via taxiway G4.
# Source: VN132_40fc4a00 G4.csv (flightradar24 export), EVERY point below is
# a verbatim MOVE from that file (lat/lon/hdg/spd), same convention as the
# existing vag672_adsb_replay.scn in this same folder.
#
# TOUCHDOWN / THRESHOLD-CROSSING ALTITUDE: per user note, the raw ADS-B
# altitude right at the RWY 35L/R threshold is unreliable (this file shows
# it stuck at 275ft for 3 consecutive samples approaching the runway, a
# quantization/lag artifact, not a real level-off). NOT altered here --
# the raw feed already drops to alt=0 at 16.043037,108.198494 (07:45:14Z,
# CAS 67kt, hdg 351), which is taken as the real touchdown point and used
# as-is (already satisfies "FL000 at touchdown"); only the few genuinely-
# still-airborne 275ft readings just before it are left untouched since
# the aircraft was not on the ground yet at that instant.
#
# REAL-WORLD CONFIRMATION of the earlier synthetic G4 taxi-in modeling
# (VVDN_DOTEN_3ACFT_TROMBONE_ILSV35L.scn's VDN601): this real track turns
# off the runway at 16.048679,108.197815 (07:45:49Z) -- within ~15m of the
# real G4 taxiway centerline start point (16.048721,108.197655) used for
# VDN601's exit, confirming that modeling was realistic. The flight then
# taxis to a stand at 16.052982,108.201851 (07:49:02Z), ~42m from real
# Gate 26 (16.05262199,108.2019728) -- i.e. this REAL HVN132/G4 flight
# actually parks at Gate 26, not Gate 24 (the gate used by the OTHER
# reference file VVDN_HVN337_ARR_EVA384_DEP_REAL.scn).

